<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:20:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>随着家庭债务飙升，巴西收紧消费贷款规则</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/brazil-tightens-consumer-lending-rules-as-household-debt-soars</link><description>由于巴西总统路易斯·伊纳西奥·卢拉·达席尔瓦对家庭债务飙升越来越担忧，巴西央行公布了遏制消费者过度借贷的措施。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/brazil-tightens-consumer-lending-rules-as-household-debt-soars'&gt;随着家庭债务飙升，巴西收紧消费贷款规则&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Brazil Tightens Consumer Lending Rules as Household Debt Soars&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/brazil-tightens-consumer-lending-rules-as-household-debt-soars</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:54:50 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Sionna 的 Kim Shannon 押注廉价精选精选，位居市场榜首</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/kim-shannon-of-sionna-tops-market-with-bet-on-cheap-value-picks</link><description>一位经验丰富的基金经理通过押注被低估的加拿大股票来跑赢基准指数。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/kim-shannon-of-sionna-tops-market-with-bet-on-cheap-value-picks'&gt;Sionna 的 Kim Shannon 押注廉价精选精选，位居市场榜首&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Kim Shannon of Sionna Tops Market With Bet on Cheap Value Picks&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/kim-shannon-of-sionna-tops-market-with-bet-on-cheap-value-picks</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:00:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>瑞士资本前景黯淡，瑞银誓言保持全球地位</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ubs-vows-to-remain-global-as-swiss-capital-outlook-darkens</link><description>瑞银集团(UBS Group AG)最高领导层本周致信员工，试图向他们保证，瑞士不断加强监管的努力不会夺走该银行数十年来努力打造的东西——真正的全球业务。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ubs-vows-to-remain-global-as-swiss-capital-outlook-darkens'&gt;瑞士资本前景黯淡，瑞银誓言保持全球地位&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：UBS Vows to Remain Global as Swiss Capital Outlook Darkens&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ubs-vows-to-remain-global-as-swiss-capital-outlook-darkens</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:08:31 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>奥驰亚研究卷烟制造商帝国品牌的交易</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands</link><description>奥驰亚集团公司正在研究一项收购英国卷烟制造商帝国品牌公司的潜在交易，这将是十年来对英国公司最大的收购之一。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands'&gt;奥驰亚研究卷烟制造商帝国品牌的交易&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Altria Studies Deal for Cigarette Maker Imperial Brands&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:08:53 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于储备减少，土耳其交易员认为降息步伐放缓</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/turkey-s-traders-see-slower-rate-cut-pace-as-reserves-shrink</link><description>由于土耳其央行准备金大幅下降，交易商正在撤回对土耳其 12 月降息的押注，这引发了人们对政策制定者支持里拉的难度可能加大的担忧。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/turkey-s-traders-see-slower-rate-cut-pace-as-reserves-shrink'&gt;由于储备减少，土耳其交易员认为降息步伐放缓&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Turkey’s Traders See Slower Rate Cut Pace as Reserves Shrink&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/turkey-s-traders-see-slower-rate-cut-pace-as-reserves-shrink</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:12:43 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>